      "text": "The CLI exposes flags including --api-url, --api-key, --api-format (anthropic|openai), --model, --resume, --fork-session, --thinking, --permission-mode, --allow/--deny patterns, --allow-outside-cwd, and --dangerously-skip-permissions."
