      "text": "The tool set includes 21 tools spanning Read, Write, Edit, Bash, Glob, Grep, WebFetch, WebSearch, Agent, task tracking tools, Skill, ToolSearch, team tools, and SendMessage, categorized as safe, write, or dangerous."
